# Closure-based disagreement on a functional-in-intent property.
:K { :letters :typedBy :machineW . }
:holmes :knows :K . :knows a dec:epistemicPredicate .
:B { :letters :typedBy :machineX . }
:watson :believes :B . :believes a dec:doxasticPredicate .
rdf:subject dec:closedFor :typedBy .
